You have sided with Slasul and helped him vanquish Ukllmswwik. You are now able to breathe underwater with ease.

You have also learned to use tridents and other exotic weapons easily (talent level [1, 1, 3, 4, 5 (LVL 1-50)] of Exotic Weapon Mastery), and can Spit Poison (talent level [1, 1, 3, 4, 5 (LVL 1-50)]) as nagas do. These are bonus talent levels that increase with your character level.

In addition, should Slasul still live, he may have a further reward for you as thanks…
